e dust is positive outside the marked sphere $R = Q^2/M = 0.92\\,M$ and negative inside it."],"source":{"fields":["coords","parameters","metric_components","inverse_metric_components","kretschmann","domains"],"version":"cdca02c0420a49a8"}}]}}
